{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "直线 y=2x+1 中的斜率 2 究竟代表什么？",
    "goals": [
      "理解一次函数中斜率 2 的几何与变化率含义：横坐标每增加 1，纵坐标增加 2",
      "掌握斜率定义式 Δy/Δx 中分子与分母的对应关系，能结合图像读出台阶式的增量变化"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "遵照偏好开门见山先给结论，再用熟悉的山路台阶比喻解释原理",
        "针对曾经颠倒 Δy 与 Δx 的情况，强调垂直升高在分子、水平前进在分母",
        "结合动态直线与点坐标变化，直观观察自变量每走 1 步因变量抬升 2 步"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 0,
        "min": -3,
        "max": 3,
        "label": "点A横坐标",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.03
        }
      },
      {
        "as": "number_02",
        "initial": 1,
        "min": -3,
        "max": 3,
        "label": "点B横坐标",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.03
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-01-task-01",
        "prompt": "拖动滑块将点 B 的横坐标调整到 3，观察 y 的变化量与斜率比值",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "把点 B 的横坐标从 2 移动到 3",
          "观察当 x=3 时，y 的值是多少，再算算从 x=0 到 x=3 的总变化比率"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "太棒了！当 x=3 时 y=7，高度从 1 升到 7 增加了 6，6/3 依然是 2！这就是斜率 2 的恒定本质。",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_02",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_02",
          "value": 3,
          "tolerance": 0.015
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_02"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "通过山路台阶比喻与动点增量，讲透 y=2x+1 中斜率 2 的直观与数学含义",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "你说过喜欢先听结论，那我们先说结论：在 y=2x+1 里，斜率 2 说的就是‘变化率’——x 每向右增加 1，y 就向上增加 2！",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "直线 y = 2x + 1",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -3,
                    "max": 3,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -10,
                    "max": 10,
                    "label": "y"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "((2)*(x))+(1)",
                    "label": "y=2x+1"
                  }
                ],
                "points": [
                  {
                    "as": "moving-point",
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 1,
                    "label": "A"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "second-point",
                    "x": 1,
                    "y": 3,
                    "label": "B"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "moving-point.x",
                    "expression": "number_01"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "moving-point.y",
                    "expression": "((2)*(number_01))+(1)"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "second-point.x",
                    "expression": "number_02"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "second-point.y",
                    "expression": "((2)*(number_02))+(1)"
                  }
                ],
                "measurement": "secant"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "k = \\frac{\\Delta y}{\\Delta x} = \\frac{y_2 - y_1}{x_2 - x_1} = 2"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "我们之前一起用‘山路’的比喻学过斜率：把直线当成坡道。你上次算斜率时把 Δy 和 Δx 颠倒过，这次我们专门看清楚：分母是水平往前走的步数 Δx，分子是竖直升高的步数 Δy！",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "斜率 2 的台阶比喻",
                "items": [
                  "Δx（分母）：水平向右走 1 步",
                  "Δy（分子）：竖直向上爬 2 格",
                  "比值：Δy / Δx = 2 / 1 = 2"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-02"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "强调斜率公式中分母为横向增量，分子为纵向增量",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "来看图上的点 A 和点 B：当 A 在 x=0 时，y 是 1；当 B 在 x=1 时，y 变成了 3。水平只前进了 1 格，高度却往上窜了 2 格，比值正好是 2！",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "如果继续往前走到 x=2 呢？我们把点 B 移到 x=2 看看。从 x=0 到 x=2，水平走了 2 步，高从 1 变成 5，升高了 4 格！4 除以 2，斜率依然是 2，坡度始终不变。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_02",
              "value": 2,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-05",
          "say": "轮到你来当小测绘员了！试着把点 B 调到 x=3，看看自变量每前进一步，高度是不是都在以 2 倍的节奏稳稳上升？",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "在直线 y=2x+1 中，斜率 2 表达的是变化率：沿着这条‘山路’水平向右每走 1 个单位（Δx=1），高度就向上攀升 2 个单位（Δy=2）。牢记升高量在分子、前进量在分母，就不会写反了！",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
